  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GGGI-KDB Partnership for GCF Climate Technopreneurship Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program aims to support innovative local entrepreneurs with climate technology solutions and promote climate technology ecosystems in developing countries that will accelerate the low carbon and climate resilient green growth.GGGI is working with KDB (AE) to prepare a GCF funding proposal and plan to work as Executing Entity for part of the Program.GCF Concept note was cleared in 2020 and currently GGGI is working with KDB to preapre PPF application. Project preparation work is expected to begin in April-May with PPF funding.</narrative>
  </description>
